燃やし尽くすマグマドラマ
magma drama burning it all up!

185
00:18:46,871 --> 00:18:48,571
この飽くなき渇き 青い炎みたい
This insatiable thirst is like a blue flame.

186
00:18:48,571 --> 00:18:50,071
死は過去のひとつ隣
Death is right next to the past,

187
00:18:50,071 --> 00:18:52,271
やがて総てひとつとなり
soon everything becomes one.

