195
00:19:25,871 --> 00:19:31,071
あぁ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time...

196
00:19:31,571 --> 00:19:35,871
あぁ ただ burn it up baby
Ah, just burn it up, baby.

197
00:19:35,871 --> 00:19:38,871
Sorry darling そんなに甘くないよ
Sorry darling, it's not that sweet.

198
00:19:38,871 --> 00:19:41,871
でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
But I'm sure it's not that bad.

199
00:19:41,871 --> 00:19:44,271
Give me fire

200
00:19:44,271 --> 00:19:48,571
Light it up baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Light it up baby, let's burn it down, yeah.

201
