00:20:49,046 --> 00:20:54,846
まず最初のゲストはカリオペ先輩に来てもらいました！
First off, our very first guest is Calliope-senpai!

214
00:20:54,846 --> 00:20:57,046
初めまして！ Hi everybody! Yo, yo, what's up?
Nice to meet you! Hi everybody! Yo, yo, what's up?

