And with that, Calliope-senpai, thank you so much!

254
00:22:38,246 --> 00:22:40,846
ありがとうございました！これから頑張ってね！ Good luck!
Thank you very much! Do your best for the rest! Good luck!

255
00:22:40,846 --> 00:22:42,546
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

256
00:22:42,546 --> 00:22:44,046
You can do it!

257
00:22:44,046 --> 00:22:46,046
