There's nothing that doesn't end, Träumerei.

307
00:27:16,594 --> 00:27:21,594
あなたと跨ぐ境界
The boundary I cross with you.

308
00:27:21,594 --> 00:27:25,594
誰も読めないカルテ
A medical chart nobody can read.

309
00:27:25,594 --> 00:27:30,594
思春期 傷口 胸のうち
Adolescence, a wound deep inside my chest,

310
00:27:30,594 --> 00:27:37,094
