Yay!

438
00:34:16,869 --> 00:34:17,669
Nice to meet you.

439
00:34:17,669 --> 00:34:20,269
Nice to meet you too! 初め... 初めましてじゃない
Nice to meet you too! Nice to... Wait, it's not our first time!

440
00:34:20,269 --> 00:34:21,369
初めましてですよ！
It IS our first time meeting!

441
00:34:21,369 --> 00:34:22,669
今日初めて会いました
We met in person for the first time today.

442
00:34:22,669 --> 00:34:24,069
今日ガチの初めまして
Today is our legit first meeting ever!

443
00:34:24,169 --> 00:34:26,869
いる？今日ガチの初めましての人、私達？
