00:48:12,140 --> 00:48:17,640
あなたの手で 抱きしめてよ
Hold me tight in your arms,

631
00:48:17,940 --> 00:48:24,740
思いっきり 怖がらないで
with all your strength, don't be afraid.

632
00:48:24,940 --> 00:48:34,340
もう大丈夫 私なら
It's alright now, if it's me.

633
00:48:34,740 --> 00:48:43,340
その手が汚れてしまったとしても
Even if those hands have become stained,

634
00:48:43,740 --> 00:48:50,940
愛してほしい
I want you to love me,

635
00:48:51,140 --> 00:48:58,940
私のこと
the real me.

636
00:49:27,140 --> 00:49:30,940
You'll never walk alone

637
00:49:30,940 --> 00:49:34,940
あなたと行く
I will go with you.

638
