どんな罪も 背負ってあげる
Whatever your sin, I'll bear it for you.

639
00:49:40,940 --> 00:49:44,940
道なき道を
Along an unpaved road,

640
00:49:44,940 --> 00:49:48,940
歩いてくの
we will keep walking,

641
00:49:48,940 --> 00:49:54,140
あなたと
with you.

642
00:49:54,940 --> 00:50:00,140
I will stay with you

643
00:50:00,715 --> 00:50:04,715
愛してほしい
I want you to love me,

644
00:50:04,915 --> 00:50:07,615
私のこと
everything about me.

645
00:50:08,115 --> 00:50:13,415
You'll never walk alone

646
00:50:13,915 --> 00:50:16,815
あなたと行く
I'll go with you.

647
00:50:17,215 --> 00:50:20,215
どんな罪も
No matter the sin,

648
00:50:20,415 --> 00:50:26,415
背負ってあげる
I'll shoulder it for you.

649
00:50:33,415 --> 00:50:38,315
Yeah...

650
00:51:30,315 --> 00:51:36,615
give it back
