658
00:52:17,315 --> 00:52:21,915
押しては返す
Resisting the waves...

659
00:52:21,915 --> 00:52:28,615
波に抗って
...that push and pull.

660
00:52:32,415 --> 00:52:36,915
白い枕に
Burying my sleep-befuddled face...

661
00:52:36,915 --> 00:52:42,315
寝ぼけたままの顔をうずめて
...in the white pillow,

662
00:52:42,515 --> 00:52:50,915
同じ夢を願うほどに
the more I wish for the same dream,

663
00:52:50,915 --> 00:52:58,715
冴えていくよ
the clearer my mind becomes.

664
00:52:59,115 --> 00:53:05,315
Please, give it back

665
00:53:05,515 --> 00:53:10,515
代わりなんていないよ
There is no replacement for you.

666
00:53:10,615 --> 00:53:15,415
あなたの匂い
I can't remember your scent,

667
00:53:15,515 --> 00:53:21,115
