668
00:53:30,115 --> 00:53:38,315
夢の続きを捕まえに行くから待ってて
I'm going to catch the rest of the dream, so wait for me.

669
00:53:38,715 --> 00:53:48,615
いつの間にか孤独ぶるには優しさに触れすぎた
Before I knew it, I'd touched too much kindness to pretend to be alone.

670
00:53:48,815 --> 00:53:52,615
