Shall I try raising my head?

672
00:53:57,015 --> 00:54:02,215
ひとりじゃないって信じてみたい
I want to try believing I'm not alone.

673
00:54:02,315 --> 00:54:08,315
信じてみたいの
I really want to believe it.

674
00:54:08,515 --> 00:54:18,215
生まれたばかりの淡い光に
In the pale light that was just born,

675
00:54:18,315 --> 00:54:23,015
