I saw hope.

676
00:54:23,015 --> 00:54:27,815
胸が熱いよ
My heart feels warm.

677
00:54:27,915 --> 00:54:32,115
手を握っていよう
Let's hold hands,

678
00:54:32,115 --> 00:54:42,615
迷わないように
so we won't get lost.

679
00:54:42,715 --> 00:54:47,415
明日からまた
Starting again tomorrow,

680
00:54:47,415 --> 00:54:54,115
選んだ道を進めるように
so that we can move forward on the path we chose.

681
00:55:31,363 --> 00:55:34,163
お前ら！まだまだ行くぞー！
Everyone! We're just getting started!

682
00:55:36,963 --> 00:55:38,363
ぶつかって
Clashing,

683
00:55:38,663 --> 00:55:40,663
逃げ込んで
running away,

684
00:55:40,963 --> 00:55:42,363
僕は
before I knew it,

685
00:55:42,663 --> 00:55:46,163
いつしかここに立ってた
I was standing right here.

686
00:55:47,163 --> 00:55:51,963
誰もが憧れるヒーローに
Wanting to be a hero everyone admires,

687
00:55:52,163 --> 00:55:53,763
なりたくて
I wanted to become one,

688
00:55:53,963 --> 00:55:56,363
でもなれなくて
but I couldn't be.

689
00:55:57,163 --> 00:56:01,663
これぐらいじゃ届かないこと
That I couldn't reach with just this,

690
00:56:01,963 --> 00:56:05,663
わかっていたのに
I already knew, even though I understood...

691
00:56:06,963 --> 00:56:08,963
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

692
00:56:09,163 --> 00:56:11,363
現実を歌え
sing of reality!

693
00:56:11,963 --> 00:56:15,663
あんな風に空は飛べやしないんだ
We can't fly through the sky like that.

694
00:56:16,963 --> 00:56:18,963
こんな夜に
If on a night like this,

695
00:56:19,163 --> 00:56:21,663
意味があるなら
there is any meaning...

696
00:56:21,963 --> 00:56:25,663
僕らは血を這う
we crawl through the blood.

697
00:56:36,363 --> 00:56:38,363
耳鳴りが
Tinnitus...

698
00:56:38,663 --> 00:56:41,663
こだまして僕に
echoing around, to me...

699
00:56:41,963 --> 00:56:45,663
奇跡が問いかけるんだ
a miracle asks a question.

700
00:56:46,963 --> 00:56:48,663
君の夢
Your dream,

701
00:56:48,963 --> 00:56:51,963
憧れたヒーローに
the hero you longed to be,

702
00:56:52,163 --> 00:56:53,763
今すぐ
right now,

703
00:56:53,963 --> 00:56:56,363
させてあげよう
I'll make it come true for you.

704
00:56:57,163 --> 00:57:01,663
雨みたいに差し伸べられたって
Even if a hand is reached out to me like rain,

705
00:57:01,963 --> 00:57:05,663
嬉しくないんだ
it brings me no joy.

706
00:57:06,363 --> 00:57:08,363
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

707
00:57:08,663 --> 00:57:10,963
存在を歌え
sing of your existence!

708
00:57:11,163 --> 00:57:15,663
君みたいに眩しくはなれないけど
I can't be dazzling like you, but...

709
00:57:16,363 --> 00:57:18,363
こんな夜に
If on a night like this,

710
00:57:18,663 --> 00:57:21,363
意味があるなら
there is any meaning...

711
00:57:21,663 --> 00:57:24,363
僕らは血を這う
we crawl through the blood,

712
00:57:24,663 --> 00:57:27,663
まだ地を賠う
still crawling the earth.

713
00:57:49,163 --> 00:57:51,163
鼓動を知って
Knowing the pulse,

714
00:57:51,363 --> 00:57:53,663
息を吸い込んで
breathing deeply in,

715
00:57:53,963 --> 00:57:57,363
僕は遠慮するよ
I will hold back.

716
00:57:58,363 --> 00:58:01,363
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

717
00:58:01,663 --> 00:58:03,963
平凡を歌え
sing of the ordinary!

718
00:58:04,163 --> 00:58:08,163
あいにくと神は信じないタチで
Unfortunately, I'm the type who doesn't believe in God,

719
00:58:08,663 --> 00:58:12,163
すれ違いの物語よ
a story of passing each other by.

720
00:58:15,163 --> 00:58:17,163
さよなら
Goodbye.

721
00:58:17,363 --> 00:58:19,663
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

722
00:58:19,963 --> 00:58:22,163
現実を歌え
sing of reality!

723
00:58:22,363 --> 00:58:27,163
僕らは泥をはいつくばる者
We are those who grovel in the mud.

724
00:58:27,963 --> 00:58:29,963
こんな夜も
Because even a night like this...

725
00:58:30,163 --> 00:58:32,963
愛しいから
...is beloved,

726
00:58:33,163 --> 00:58:35,963
僕らは血を賠う
we crawl through the blood,

727
00:58:36,163 --> 00:58:39,363
ただ地を賠う
simply crawling the earth.

728
00:59:15,963 --> 00:59:17,163
あのね
Listen...

729
00:59:44,363 --> 00:59:45,763
あのね
Listen...

730
00:59:45,963 --> 00:59:47,663
私大丈夫
I'm okay,

731
00:59:47,763 --> 00:59:49,663
maybe うまくやれるはず
maybe I can pull it off.

732
00:59:49,963 --> 00:59:52,163
ずっと走った 息継ぎもしないまま
I kept running without taking a breath.

733
00:59:52,363 --> 00:59:54,963
あっそう 終わりが来るなら
Oh right, if the end is coming,

734
00:59:55,163 --> 00:59:56,963
別に寂しくなんかない
it's not like I'm lonely.

735
00:59:57,163 --> 00:59:58,363
真実は
The truth is,

736
00:59:58,463 --> 01:00:00,163
心の奥の方
deep down in my heart...

737
01:00:00,438 --> 01:00:04,338
せつないまま 君のこと守れるのかな
Can I protect you while remaining in sorrow, I wonder?

738
01:00:06,938 --> 01:00:10,638
どうか正真正銘のこの想いを
Please, this genuine feeling of mine,

739
01:00:10,638 --> 01:00:12,738
立ったステージの上で
on the stage I've stood upon,

740
01:00:12,738 --> 01:00:14,338
歌うから
I will sing, so...

741
01:00:14,338 --> 01:00:17,138
大丈夫 世界はこんなに綺麗だと
It's okay, I know that the world is this beautiful,

742
01:00:17,138 --> 01:00:19,138
分かってる 分かってる 分かってる
I know, I know, I know,

743
01:00:19,138 --> 01:00:21,138
分かってるよ ごめんね
I know, I'm sorry.

744
01:00:21,138 --> 01:00:22,438
じれったい
It's frustrating,

745
01:00:22,438 --> 01:00:23,338
足りない
not enough,

746
01:00:23,338 --> 01:00:25,338
こんなんじゃ誰も愛せないの
like this I can't love anyone.

747
01:00:25,338 --> 01:00:28,138
止めない 止まることはしないの
I won't stop, I won't ever stop.

748
01:00:28,138 --> 01:00:32,138
言葉 散らす なくしてしまうものばかりだ
Words scatter, so many things lost,

749
01:00:32,138 --> 01:00:38,138
あぁ Luna say maybe
ah, Luna say maybe,

750
01:00:38,138 --> 01:00:43,138
夜に紛れ
lost in the night.

751
01:00:48,638 --> 01:00:52,138
愛せ どんな自分でも
Love, no matter who I am,

752
01:00:52,138 --> 01:00:54,738
Maybe 色に染まるまで
maybe, until I'm dyed in color.

753
01:00:54,738 --> 01:00:59,138
時間はかかるかもしれないけど
It might take time, but...

754
01:00:59,138 --> 01:01:03,138
愛の輝くしかないこと ハイライト塗り続けるしかない
With only love to shine, I can only keep highlighting.

755
01:01:03,138 --> 01:01:08,138
信じ... ちゃんと言わなくちゃ ねぇ
Believe... I have to say it properly, hey.

756
01:01:08,138 --> 01:01:12,938
見えるものが
Things that can be seen...

757
01:01:12,938 --> 01:01:16,938
続くとずっと...
continue forever...

758
01:01:16,938 --> 01:01:21,938
君に半信半疑なそぶりして
Acting half-doubtful toward you,

759
01:01:21,938 --> 01:01:25,938
心から空回りと
getting flustered from the bottom of my heart

760
01:01:25,938 --> 01:01:29,938
空回り 最低だ もう一回やり直せるのなら
and spiraling, it's the worst; if I can start over once more,

761
01:01:29,938 --> 01:01:33,638
素直になりたい なりたい なりたい
I want to be honest, want to be, want to be,

762
01:01:33,638 --> 01:01:36,638
って願ったジレンマ
the dilemma I wished for.

763
01:01:36,638 --> 01:01:40,138
このまま一人じゃ何もできない
Like this, alone I can't do anything,

764
01:01:40,138 --> 01:01:43,138
全部決めるのは自分次第
deciding everything is up to myself.

765
01:01:43,138 --> 01:01:46,138
初めて背中を見たときに
When I first saw your back,

766
01:01:46,138 --> 01:01:50,138
カッコ決めた どこまで行けるのか
I made up my mind; how far can I go?

767
01:01:50,138 --> 01:01:53,138
届くのか
Will I reach?

768
01:01:53,138 --> 01:01:57,138
分からないよ
I don't know,

769
01:01:57,138 --> 01:02:01,138
臆病がそこに立っている
cowardice stands right there.

770
01:02:01,138 --> 01:02:04,638
3秒前 バックステージ 震える背中を君にあずけて
Three seconds ago backstage, leaving my trembling back to you,

771
01:02:04,638 --> 01:02:08,138
これ運命と言って 愛は
calling this fate, love is...

772
01:02:08,138 --> 01:02:11,638
きっと
Surely,

773
01:02:11,638 --> 01:02:15,138
そうきっと
yes, surely,

774
01:02:15,138 --> 01:02:19,638
偶然みたいな たぶん神様のいたずらです
like a coincidence, probably God's playful prank.

775
01:02:19,638 --> 01:02:22,638
どうか正真正銘のこの
Please, until this genuine

776
01:02:22,638 --> 01:02:26,138
想いが君の心にちゃんと届くまで
feeling properly reaches your heart,

777
01:02:26,138 --> 01:02:29,938
ここで立ったステージの上で
here on the stage I've stood upon,

778
01:02:29,938 --> 01:02:32,938
歌うから 待ってる 待ってる
I will sing, so I'm waiting, waiting.

779
01:02:32,938 --> 01:02:35,638
だからこの場所を大切にしたいの
That's why I want to treasure this place,

780
01:02:35,638 --> 01:02:39,138
これが正真正銘の私だ
this is the genuine me.

781
01:02:39,138 --> 01:02:43,138
大丈夫 もう怖くはないわ
It's okay, I'm not scared anymore.

782
01:02:43,138 --> 01:02:48,138
たまにつまずくことならあるけど
Though sometimes I stumble,

783
01:02:48,138 --> 01:02:52,638
一番特等席で君の笑顔を見たいんだ
I want to see your smile from the best front-row seat,

784
01:02:52,638 --> 01:02:55,638
私だけの特権
my own special privilege.

785
01:02:55,638 --> 01:02:58,338
あぁ 見えない未来 手探り今日も
Ah, an unseen future, groping through today as well,

786
01:02:58,338 --> 01:03:03,638
ステージの上で証明してみせるから
I'll prove it to you on top of the stage, so...

787
01:03:03,638 --> 01:03:10,138
あぁ...
Ah...

788
01:03:10,138 --> 01:03:17,138
ここにしかない ストーリー
A story that exists only here.

789
01:03:17,138 --> 01:03:25,638
君にまだ話せてないことばかりあるんだ
There are so many things I haven't told you yet,

790
01:03:25,638 --> 01:03:28,138
聴いてほしいの あのね
I want you to listen, you know...

791
01:03:28,138 --> 01:03:31,138
Yeah...

792
01:03:56,638 --> 01:04:00,138
今日は見に来てくれて本当にありがとう！
Thank you all so much for coming to watch today!

793
01:04:00,138 --> 01:04:04,638
最後は新曲をお届けします！聴いてください！
For the last song, I'll deliver my new song! Please listen!

794
01:04:21,138 --> 01:04:23,638
目覚めの合図
The signal to wake up,

795
01:04:23,638 --> 01:04:26,138
スマホが踊る
my smartphone dances.

796
01:04:26,138 --> 01:04:31,638
そして半分眠った瞳で
And with half-asleep eyes,

797
01:04:31,638 --> 01:04:35,138
心の震えは A=440Hz
my heart's vibration is A=440Hz.

798
01:04:35,138 --> 01:04:39,138
今日のリズムは合言葉で合わせよう
Let's match today's rhythm with our secret code.

799
01:04:39,138 --> 01:04:41,638
ドゥルドゥル ドゥルドゥルドゥ
Duruduru durudurudu,

800
01:04:41,638 --> 01:04:47,638
一歩前に レガート深呼吸
one step forward, a legato deep breath.

801
01:04:47,638 --> 01:04:53,638
会う前には 二度の瞬き
Before we meet, two blinks.

802
01:04:53,638 --> 01:04:58,138
月曜の約束を奏でよう
Let me play our Monday promise.

803
01:04:58,138 --> 01:05:00,138
ねぇ 君と僕の合図
Hey, the signal between you and me.

804
01:05:00,186 --> 01:05:02,686
ねぇ、君と僕の合図
Hey, this is our sign.

805
01:05:11,986 --> 01:05:15,686
もう一歩を 踏み出して
Take one more step forward,

806
01:05:16,186 --> 01:05:21,986
踏み出して 合わせてみよう
step out and let's match our pace.

807
01:05:22,186 --> 01:05:24,586
なんでマンデー どうしてサンデー
Why Monday? How come Sunday?

808
01:05:24,686 --> 01:05:27,886
明日へ 弾んでいたいの
I want to bound toward tomorrow.

809
01:05:28,186 --> 01:05:30,986
タクトを シュッ・シュッ 拍手を パン・パン
Baton goes swish-swish, applause goes clap-clap.

810
01:05:31,086 --> 01:05:34,686
ここからは すべてダ・カーポ
From here on, it's all Da Capo.

811
01:05:34,986 --> 01:05:41,686
日曜日の コーダを飛び越えて
Leaping over Sunday's coda...

812
01:05:42,186 --> 01:05:44,186
待ってるよ
I'll be waiting.

813
01:05:44,386 --> 01:05:49,386
明日よ来ないでと 願ってしまうほど
So much that I wish tomorrow wouldn't come.

814
01:05:50,186 --> 01:05:53,986
(La La La)

815
01:05:54,186 --> 01:06:01,186
あなたを 待ちわびる 時間すらも愛おしい
Even the time spent eagerly awaiting you is precious.

816
01:06:05,186 --> 01:06:10,186
一歩前に レガート深呼吸
One step forward, legato deep breath.

817
01:06:10,386 --> 01:06:15,386
スタッカートで 二度の瞬き
Blink twice in staccato.

818
01:06:15,686 --> 01:06:20,986
月曜の約束を 奏でよう
Let's play the promise of Monday.

819
01:06:21,186 --> 01:06:25,686
ねぇ、君と僕の合図
Hey, this is our sign.

820
01:06:34,186 --> 01:06:36,186
奏でよう
Let's play it.

821
01:06:36,386 --> 01:06:39,386
ねぇ、叶うよ
Hey, it will come true.

822
01:06:39,686 --> 01:06:43,686
私達だけの合図
A sign just for us.

823
01:06:51,486 --> 01:06:58,386
なんと！最後の曲は、奏自身の2作目のオリ曲『You & 合図』でしたー！
And that last song was Kanade's second original song, "You & Aizu"!

824
01:06:58,486 --> 01:07:00,186
